{"ticker":"IR","updated":"2026-10-30T22:54:12Z","profile":{"longName":"Ingersoll Rand Inc.","shortName":"Ingersoll Rand Inc.","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Specialty Industrial Machinery","country":"United States","website":"https://www.irco.com","fullTimeEmployees":21000,"marketCap":31059355648,"trailingPE":32.942387,"forwardPE":20.483624,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3.910674,"pegRatio":0.65,"targetMeanPrice":94.09615,"targetHighPrice":109.0,"targetLowPrice":82.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":13,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.085,"earningsGrowth":null,"grossMargins":0.42821,"operatingMargins":0.16882999,"profitMargins":0.12076,"totalRevenue":7942199808,"beta":1.152,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":100.96,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":68.07,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.1},"summary":"Ingersoll Rand Inc. provides mission-critical air, fluid, clean energy, and medical technologies services and solutions worldwide. It operates in two segments, Industrial Technologies and Services, and Precision and Science Technologies. The Industrial Technologies and Services segment designs, manufactures, markets, and services a range of air and gas compression and treatment equipment, vacuum and blower products, fluid transfer equipment, loading systems, and power tools and lifting equipment; and other specialized equipment, including aftermarket parts, consumables and services, air treatment equipment, controls, other accessories, and services under the Ingersoll Rand, Gardner Denver, Nash, CompAir, Elmo Rietschle, and other brands. The Precision and Science Technologies segment designs, manufactures, and markets diaphragm, piston, water-powered, peristaltic, gear, vane, progressive cavity, and syringe pumps; and gas boosters, hydrogen compression systems, liquid handling systems, odorant injection systems, controls, software, and other related components and accessories for precision dosing, liquid and solid transfer, dispensing, gas compression and sampling, pressure management, flow control, powder handling, and other applications under the Air Dimensions, Albin, ARO, Dosatron, Haskel, Ingersoll Rand, LMI, Maximus, Milton Roy, MP, Oberdorfer, Seepex, Thomas, Welch, Will","summary_zh":"Ingersoll Rand Inc. 在全球範圍內提供關鍵任務空氣、流體、清潔能源和醫療技術服務和解決方案。它分為兩個部門：工業技術和服務部門以及精密和科學技術部門。工業技術和服務部門設計、製造、行銷和服務一系列空氣和氣體壓縮和處理設備、真空和鼓風機產品、流體輸送設備、裝載系統以及電動工具和起重設備；和其他專業設備，包括 Ingersoll Rand、Gardner Denver、Nash、CompAir、Elmo Rietschle 和其他品牌的售後零件、設備和服務、空氣處理設備、設備和服務裝置。精密與科學技術部門設計、製造和銷售隔膜泵、活塞泵、水動力泵、蠕動泵、齒輪泵、葉片泵、螺桿泵和注射泵；氣體增壓器、氫氣壓縮系統、液體處理系統、加味劑注射系統、控制器、軟體以及其他相關組件和配件，用於精確測量、液體和固體傳輸、分配、氣體流量和壓縮Dimensions、Albin、ARO、Dosatron、Haskel、Ingersoll Rand、LMI、Maximus、Milton Roy、MP、Oberdorfer、Seepex、Thomas、Welch、Will 下的其他應用","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"特種工業機械","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":78.6,"h":78.925,"l":77.23,"c":77.94,"v":2228700},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":77.58,"h":78.105,"l":76.87,"c":77.38,"v":1567300},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":77.39,"h":79.7,"l":77.15,"c":79.2,"v":2898000},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":79.93,"h":81.5,"l":79.523,"c":80.95,"v":3149700},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":80.95,"h":81.28,"l":79.21,"c":80.38,"v":4536500},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":80.05,"h":80.53,"l":79.02,"c":79.66,"v":3291700},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":79.68,"h":81.12,"l":79.37,"c":80.24,"v":2742800},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":80.05,"h":82.36,"l":79.95,"c":81.02,"v":4317800},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":80.81,"h":81.3,"l":78.76,"c":78.79,"v":3643400},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":79.25,"h":80.09,"l":78.45,"c":79.05,"v":3002800},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":78.94,"h":79.4,"l":77.495,"c":77.7,"v":3499700},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":78.23,"h":80.2,"l":77.85,"c":79.0,"v":5521200},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":79.76,"h":81.59,"l":79.345,"c":81.53,"v":4119700},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":81.77,"h":82.23,"l":80.37,"c":81.61,"v":13598000},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":80.63,"h":81.93,"l":79.82,"c":81.8,"v":3649800},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":82.19,"h":82.39,"l":80.76,"c":81.32,"v":4315100},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":81.07,"h":81.83,"l":80.625,"c":80.91,"v":3747500},{"t":