ts Ingersoll Rand (IR) incur up to $400K a year in extra personal-flight costs.","src":"Stock Titan","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxOV2E2R3U2OHVHdGJtdHdzRW1CM0dWT1h6cFM3MDNJQV9mMDZvVWc5NHBMX2RZcHJ2YmZVdk5RNy1ZMFl1VmNtZ2VqTFpiLUNLLVJ0THFvQ3RpVmRLaVB1TkVLYXhJNmFfakZweHJGdXMtRVgwRXlfVzNkNzZOSTVkQ3MzZkFJcG50UC1rLTlWLVhra2lMb3lZR0hMSE1CZUxpemlsUGJDS0E?oc=5","date":"2026-10-30","zh":"執行長合約延期使 Ingersoll Rand (IR) 每年承擔高達 40 萬美元的額外個人飛行費用。"},{"title":"What Ingersoll Rand (IR) Said on Its Q3 Earnings Call","src":"MarketBeat","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-30","zh":"英格索蘭 (IR) 在第三季財報電話會議上的講話"},{"title":"Ingersoll Rand (IR) Lifts 2026 Revenue Guidance, Is The Stock Fully Valued?","src":"Simply Wall St","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-30","zh":"英格索蘭 (IR) 上調 2026 年收入指引，股票估值是否充分？"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":8},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":5},{"name":"資料中心","count":1},{"name":"減重藥/生技","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-17","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1699150/000162828026008617/iri-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Ingersoll Rand Inc. is a diversified, global provider of mission-critical flow creation products, and industrial and life science solutions. The accompanying consolidated financial statements include the accounts of Ingersoll Rand Inc. and its majority-owned subsidiaries (collectively referred to herein as \"Ingersoll Rand,\" \"Company,\" \"we,\" \"us,\" \"our,\" or \"ourselves\").","zh":"Ingersoll Rand Inc. 是一家多元化的全球供應商，提供任務關鍵型流程創建產品以及工業和生命科學解決方案。隨附的合併財務報表包括英格索蘭公司及其控股子公司（本文統稱為「英格索蘭」、「本公司」、「我們」或「我們自己」）的帳目。"},{"en":"We are a global market leader with a broad flow creation and industrial product portfolio across air, gas, powder, and liquid handling applications, providing services and solutions to increase industrial and life science productivity, efficiency, and sustainability. We manufacture one of the broadest and most complete ranges of compressor, pump, vacuum and blower products in our markets, which, when combined with our global geographic footprint and application expertise, allows us to provide differentiated product and service offerings to our customers. Our products are sold under more than 90 market-leading brands, including Ingersoll Rand and Gardner Denver, which we believe are globally recognized in their respective end-markets and known for product quality, reliability, efficiency and superior customer service. We are driven by an entrepreneurial spirit and ownership mindset, dedic","zh":"我們是全球市場領導者，在空氣、氣體、粉末和液體處理應用領域擁有廣泛的流程創造和工業產品組合，提供服務和解決方案以提高工業和生命科學的生產力、效率和永續性。我們生產市場上最廣泛、最齊全的壓縮機、泵浦、真空和鼓風機產品系列之一，結合我們的全球地理足跡和應用專業知識，使我們能夠為客戶提供差異化的產品和服務。我們的產品以 90 多個市場領先品牌銷售，包括 Ingersoll Rand 和 Gardner Denver，我們相信這些品牌在各自的終端市場中獲得全球認可，並以產品品質、可靠性、效率和卓越的客戶服務而聞名。我們以企業家精神和主人翁心態為動力，致力於"},{"en":"These attributes, along with over 165 years of engineering heritage, generate strong brand loyalty for our products and foster long-standing customer relationships, resulting in leading market positions within each of our operating segments. We have sales in all major geographic markets and our diverse customer base utilizes our products across a wide array of end-markets, including life sciences, food and beverage production, clean energy, industrial manufacturing, infrastructure, water and wastewater treatment, and many others.","zh":"這些屬性加上超過 165 年的工程傳統，為我們的產品帶來了強大的品牌忠誠度，並培養了長期的客戶關係，從而在我們的每個營運部門中佔據了領先的市場地位。我們的銷售遍及所有主要地理市場，我們多元化的客戶群在廣泛的終端市場中使用我們的產品，包括生命科學、食品和飲料生產、清潔能源、工業製造、基礎設施、水和廢水處理等。"}],"markets":[{"en":"We design, manufacture, market and service a broad range of air and gas compression and treatment equipment, vacuum and blower products, fluid transfer equipment, loading systems, power tools and lifting equipment, and other specialized equipment including associated aftermarket parts, consumables and services. We primarily sell under the Ingersoll Rand, Gardner Denver, Nash, CompAir, Elmo Rietschle, and over 35 other brands. Our customers deploy our products across a wide array of applications in diverse end-markets. Compressors are used to increase the pressure of air or gas, vacuum products are used to remove air or gas in order to reduce the pressure below atmospheric levels, and blower products are used to produce a high volume of air or gas at low pressure. Almost every manufacturing and industrial facility, and many service and process industry applications, use air compression, v","zh":"我們設計、製造、行銷和服務各種空氣和氣體壓縮和處理設備、真空和鼓風機產品、流體輸送設備、裝載系統、電動工具和起重設備，以及其他專業設備，包括相關的售後零件、消耗品和服務。我們主要以 Ingersoll Rand、Gardner Denver、Nash、CompAir、Elmo Rietschle 以及超過 35 個其他品牌進行銷售。我們的客戶將我們的產品部署在不同終端市場的各種應用中。壓縮機用於增加空氣或氣體的壓力，真空產品用於去除空氣或氣體，以將壓力降低到大氣壓力以下，鼓風機產品用於在低壓下產生大量空氣或氣體。幾乎每個製造和工業設施以及許多服務和流程工業應用都使用空氣壓縮、v"},{"en":"Our compression products cover the full range of technologies, including rotary screw, reciprocating piston, scroll, rotary vane and centrifugal compressors. Our vacuum products and blowers also cover the full technology spectrum; vacuum technologies include side channel, liquid ring, claw vacuum, screw, turbo and rotary vane vacuum pumps among others, while blower technologies include rotary lobe, screw, claw and vane, side channel and radial blowers.","zh":"我們的壓縮產品涵蓋全系列技術，包括螺旋壓縮機、往復活塞壓縮機、渦旋壓縮機、旋片壓縮機和離心壓縮機。我們的真空產品和鼓風機還涵蓋了完整的技術範圍；真空技術包括側通道、液環、爪式真空泵、螺桿、渦輪和旋片真空泵等，而鼓風機技術包括旋轉凸輪、螺桿、爪和葉片、側通道和徑流式鼓風機。"}],"customers":[{"en":"We consider superior customer service to be one of our primary pillars of future success and view it as being built upon a foundation of critical application expertise, an industry leading range of compressor, pump, vacuum and blower products, a global manufacturing and sales presence and a long-standing reputation for quality and reliability. Intense customer focus is at the center of our vision of becoming the industry's first choice for innovative and application-critical flow creation equipment, services and solutions. We strive to collaborate with our customers and become an essential part of their engineering process by drawing on our deep industry and application engineering experience.","zh":"我們認為卓越的客戶服務是我們未來成功的主要支柱之一，並將其視為建立在關鍵應用專業知識、行業領先的壓縮機、泵、真空和鼓風機產品系列、全球製造和銷售網路以及質量和可靠性方面的長期聲譽的基礎上。我們致力於成為業界創新和關鍵應用流程創建設備、服務和解決方案的首選，這一願景的核心是對客戶的強烈關注。我們努力與客戶合作，利用我們深厚的產業和應用工程經驗，成為他們工程流程的重要組成部分。"},{"en":"We have established strong and long-standing customer relationships with numerous industry leaders. We sell our products directly to end-use customers and to certain OEMs, EPCs (engineering, procurement, and construction firms) and indirectly through independent distributors and sales representatives.","zh":"我們與眾多行業領導者建立了牢固且長期的客戶關係。我們將產品直接銷售給最終用戶以及某些 OEM、EPC（工程、採購和建築公司），並透過獨立經銷商和銷售代表間接銷售。"}],"competition":[{"en":"The industrial end-markets we serve are competitive, with an increasing focus on product quality, performance, energy efficiency, customer service and local presence. Although there are several large manufacturers of compression, vacuum and blower products, the marketplace for these products remains highly fragmented due to the wide variety of product technologies, applications and selling channels. Our principal competitors in sales of compression, vacuum and blower products include Atlas Copco, Flowserve, IDEX Corporation, Kaeser Compressors, Kaishan Group Co., Ltd. and Elgi Equipments Limited.","zh":"我們服務的工業終端市場競爭激烈，越來越注重產品品質、性能、能源效率、客戶服務和本地影響力。儘管有多家大型壓縮、真空和鼓風機產品製造商，但由於產品技術、應用和銷售管道多種多樣，這些產品的市場仍然高度分散。我們在壓縮、真空和鼓風機產品銷售方面的主要競爭對手包括阿特拉斯·科普柯、福斯、IDEX Corporation、凱撒壓縮機、開山集團有限公司和 Elgi Equipments Limited。"},{"en":"Competition in the markets served by our Precision and Science Technologies segment is primarily based on product quality and performance, as most products must be qualified by the customer for a particular use. Further, there is an increasing demand for more efficient healthcare solutions, which is driving the adoption of premium and high performance systems. Our primary competitors include Dover, Graco, IDEX Corporation, KNF Neuberger, Netzsch, NOV, Sartorius, SPX Flow, Thermo Fisher Scientific, and Watson-Marlow, as well as other regional and local manufacturers.","zh":"我們的精密和科學技術部門所服務的市場競爭主要基於產品品質和性能，因為大多數產品必須經過客戶的特定用途來鑑定。此外，對更高效的醫療保健解決方案的需求不斷增長，這推動了優質高效能係統的採用。我們的主要競爭對手包括 Dover、Graco、IDEX Corporation、KNF Neuberger、Netzsch、NOV、Sartorius、SPX Flow、Thermo Fisher Scientific 和 Watson-Marlow，以及其他區域和本地製造商。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Industrial Technologies & Services","val":6056400000,"zh":"工業技術與服務部門"},{"name":"Precision & Science Technologies","val":1594500000,"zh":"精密與科學技術部門"}],"total":7650900000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Original Equipment","val":4861800000,"zh":"原始設備"},{"name":"Aftermarket","val":2789100000,"zh":"售後市場"}],"total":7650900000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Americas","val":3802000000,"zh":"美洲"},{"name":"US","val":3189900000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"EMEA","val":2601500000,"zh":"歐洲、中東和非洲地區"},{"name":"Asia Pacific","val":1247400000,"zh":"亞太"},{"name":"CN","val":789500000,"zh":"中國"},{"name":"Other Americas","val":612100000,"zh":"其他美洲"},{"name":"Other Asia Pacific","val":457900000,"zh":"其他亞太地區"}],"total":7650900000}},"peers":["PH","ITW","ALLE","DOV","MAS"]}}